    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e9W Angular 90° L LED Connector,\u003c/strong\u003e specifically designed for use in POLARIS LED Linear Pendant Lamps. \u003cstrong\u003eDesigned to join two luminaires continuously thanks to its 90° angular shape.\u003c/strong\u003e Quick and easy mounting with all necessary accessories included. \u003cstrong\u003eInnovative design allows light passage at the ends\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
